40/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T09:35:51.544296+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Build unique class-and-race combinations, shape your talents, and test your strategy in a tactical roguelike dungeon crawler packed with campaigns, challenge runs, loot, bosses, and replayable depth. Your plan may be brilliant. The dungeon may disagree.","detailedDescription":"Choose from multiple races and classes that meaningfully change how your hero fights, survives, and grows, then tackle a traditional roguelike built around tactical turn-based combat, procedural dungeons, persistent unlocks, and multiple ways to play. \n\nRogue Empire combines classic dungeon-crawling tension with a more modern interface, different game modes, and high replay value.  \n\nEvery hero starts with a class — None end the same\n\nBuild your hero from race, class, and difficulty choices, then grow through a mix of class identity, player choice, emergent talent offers, spells, loot, and rare rewards.\n\n“Some builds become legends. Others become lessons.”\n\n  \n\nExplore, quest and challenge yourself\n\nChoose how you want to play. Follow the main campaign, chase optional quests, explore the world map, discover points of interest, or push into special modes where the stakes rise the deeper you crawl.\n\n“One more floor is always a reasonable idea. Until it isn’t.”\n\n  \n\nEvery turn opens new opportunities\n\nFight through turn-based grid battles against dangerous enemies, champion variants, and unique bosses, using positioning, talents, magic, items, traps, and resource management to turn each encounter in your favor.\n\nUncover forgotten secrets, claim legendary items, and complete powerful item sets.\n\n“A strict no-refunds policy applies. Mostly to your life.”\n\nDeath Is Not the End\n\nUnlock new perks, discover illustrated story paths, reach different endings, and climb the leaderboards.\n\n “Your hero may fall, but at least they were useful currency.”"